      "title": "Institutional Effectiveness, Grants and Planning - Moorpark College",
      "url": "https://www.moorparkcollege.edu/departments/administrative/institutional-research-and-planning",
      "summary": "The Institutional Effectiveness, Grants and Planning division at Moorpark College is dedicated to supporting the college's mission by providing reliable data and engaging in continuous improvement processes. It offers program review data, institutional effectiveness reports, and access to student learning outcomes. The division is involved in planning and documentation to promote program effectiveness and sponsors educational initiatives such as sponsoring Tonka the Badger at America's Teaching Zoo.",
